    "🌑 New Year's Eclipse": "🌑 新年之蝕",
    "The final phase begins January 1 at 6:00 PM ET. If Aden has restored 100% Starlight, the Winter King may cross into a Frost-Touched region. Every meaningful participant receives a dependable Bounty; rare prestige drops remain separate.": "最終階段於 1 月 1 日 18:00 ET 開始。若亞丁已恢復 100% 星光，冬王可能跨入某個霜觸區域。每位實質參與者都會獲得穩定的賞金；稀有的榮耀掉落另行計算。",
