    "Treasure Gremlins are slipping through Aden with stolen riches, strange portals, and a very angry Goblin King close behind.": "寶藏葛林帶著偷來的財寶與奇怪的傳送門在亞丁四處流竄，後面還跟著一隻非常生氣的哥布林王。",
