    "Up to two players awarded and up to two keys per realm": "每個領域最多兩名玩家獲獎、最多兩把鑰匙",
    "Treasure Gremlins are slipping through Aden with stolen riches, strange portals, and a very angry Goblin King close behind. Track them down during the event for a chance to break into short treasure realms filled with goblins, rewards, and timed chaos.": "寶藏葛林帶著偷來的財寶與奇怪的傳送門在亞丁四處流竄，後面還跟著一隻非常生氣的哥布林王。活動期間追捕牠們，就有機會闖進充滿哥布林、獎勵與限時混亂的短暫寶藏領域。",
    "Hunt Treasure Gremlins": "狩獵寶藏葛林",
    "Find and defeat eligible Treasure Gremlins while hunting. Each eligible kill rolls independently for a portal; there is no fixed kill count that guarantees the next portal. The Goblin King's boss portal is more rare.": "狩獵時找出並擊敗符合條件的寶藏葛林。每次擊殺都獨立擲骰決定是否開啟傳送門；沒有固定擊殺數保證下一個傳送門。哥布林王的 Boss 傳送門更稀有。",
    "Enter your portal": "進入你的傳送門",
    "The portal appears where its gremlin was defeated and remains open for": "傳送門會出現在葛林被擊敗的地點，並開放",
    "120 seconds": "120 秒",
    ". Click it to enter. If the available instance pool is full, keep trying while the portal remains open; a refused attempt does not consume the portal.": "。點擊即可進入。若可用的副本已滿，請在傳送門開放期間持續嘗試；被拒絕的嘗試不會消耗傳送門。",
    "Bring your party": "帶上隊伍",
    "A portal is bound to the player who opened it and to that player's client profile. Members of the same party and the same Standard or Classic profile can enter that portal and share one realm; unrelated players and mixed-profile parties cannot.": "傳送門綁定開啟它的玩家及其客戶端模式。同一隊伍且同為標準或經典模式的成員可以進入並共用一個領域；無關玩家與混合模式的隊伍不行。",
    "Clear the realm": "清理領域",
    "The three regular realms are combat-and-treasure runs. Clear the event goblins, collect the Goblin King's Chest, and watch for hazards. The Goblin King's Prison is the special route to the key.": "三個一般領域是戰鬥加尋寶的關卡。清理活動哥布林、收集哥布林王寶箱，並留意危險機制。哥布林王的監獄是取得鑰匙的特殊路線。",
    "Goblin portals": "哥布林傳送門",
    "Vault of Riches": "財富金庫",
