    "Search by monster name, ID, or drop item above.": "請在上方以怪物名稱、ID 或掉落道具搜尋。",
    "Search items, monsters, fixed NPCs, and monster drops. Fixed NPCs show their exact coordinates and map names. Enter either an ID or part of a name. Drop chances shown here already include the live drop multiplier, except event monsters and treasure boxes where exact rates are hidden. Click a map name under a monster to open its map guide.": "搜尋道具、怪物、固定 NPC 與怪物掉落。固定 NPC 會顯示精確座標與地圖名稱。輸入 ID 或名稱的一部分即可。這裡顯示的掉落率已包含目前的掉落倍率，活動怪物與寶箱除外，其精確機率不公開。點怪物下方的地圖名稱可開啟該地圖指南。",
