    "Compared with stock, Reborn adds: Two isolated progression profiles: Standard and Classic. A custom EXP curve, daily combat EXP pacing, Einhasad support, and level 77 as the practical pro…": "與原版相比，Reborn 新增了：兩個彼此獨立的成長模式：標準與經典。自訂經驗值曲線、每日戰鬥經驗值節奏、殷海薩 支援，以及以 77 級作為實際的成長上限…",
    "Compared with stock, Reborn adds:": "與原版相比，Reborn 新增了：",
    "Two isolated progression profiles:": "兩個彼此獨立的成長模式：",
    "and": "與",
    ".": "。",
    "A custom EXP curve, daily combat EXP pacing, Einhasad support, and level 77 as the practical progression ceiling.": "自訂經驗值曲線、每日戰鬥經驗值節奏、殷海薩 支援，以及以 77 級作為實際的成長上限。",
    "Revised class formulas, more meaningful control resistance, spell criticals, and class-specific runes.": "修訂過的職業公式、更有意義的控制抗性、魔法爆擊，以及職業專屬符文。",
    "Three rune slots and a large rune build system.": "三個符文槽與龐大的符文配置系統。",
    "Accessory enchant progression, Karmic Scroll customization, Dragon Magic Eyes, custom armor sets, dolls, and many new item paths.": "飾品強化進程、Karmic 卷軸自訂、龍之魔眼、自訂防具套裝、魔法娃娃，以及許多新的道具路線。",
    "TOI, Forgotten Island, Fire Valley, and Dragon Valley Dungeon Hard Modes.": "傲慢之塔、遺忘之島、火龍窟與龍之谷地監的困難模式。",
    "Champion and Mythic monsters, expanded bosses, Wanted dragon raids, renewed dungeons, seasonal events, and rotating bonus content.": "冠軍與神話怪物、擴充的 Boss、通緝龍突襲、翻新的地監、季節活動，以及輪替的加成內容。",
    "Pet talents, pet equipment, exotic pets, pet/summon controls, companion criticals, and better companion persistence.": "寵物天賦、寵物裝備、特殊寵物、寵物／召喚獸操控、同伴爆擊，以及更穩定的同伴保存。",
    "Ranked/skirmish Arena, expanded siege systems, PvP assists and statistics, bounties, and ten-player parties.": "排名／遭遇戰競技場、擴充的攻城系統、PvP 助攻與統計、懸賞，以及十人隊伍。",
    "Website Auction House, offline shops, web-account storage, equipment sets, daily rewards, detailed lookup, boss schedules, and extensive in-game tracking commands.": "網站拍賣場、離線商店、網站帳號倉儲、裝備組合、每日獎勵、詳細查詢、Boss 時程，以及完整的遊戲內追蹤指令。",
    "The remainder explains the meaningful differences in depth.": "接下來會深入說明這些有意義的差異。",
    "Addition/Rework. An account is assigned to either the Standard or Classic rate profile. The profiles can occupy the same physical world, but important interactions are separated: Standard…": "新增／重做。每個帳號會被指定為標準或經典倍率模式。兩種模式可以在同一個實體世界裡，但重要的互動是分開的：標準…",
    "Addition/Rework.": "新增／重做。",
    "An account is assigned to either the Standard or Classic rate profile. The profiles can occupy the same physical world, but important interactions are separated:": "每個帳號會被指定為標準或經典倍率模式。兩種模式可以在同一個實體世界裡，但重要的互動是分開的：",
    "Standard uses": "標準使用",
    "5x EXP, 4x Adena, and 2x item drops": "5 倍經驗值、4 倍金幣、2 倍道具掉落",
    "before map, event, Einhasad, and other situational modifiers.": "，再套用地圖、活動、殷海薩 與其他情境加成。",
    "Classic uses": "經典使用",
    "1x EXP, 1x Adena, and 1x item drops": "1 倍經驗值、1 倍金幣、1 倍道具掉落",
    "Classic and Standard use profile-specific monster ownership, drops, events, trade rules, trade areas, castle treasuries, rankings, and many reward limits.": "經典與標準各自使用自己的怪物歸屬、掉落、活動、交易規則、交易區、城堡金庫、排名，以及許多獎勵上限。",
    "Direct trade is restricted to the same profile. Cross-profile party invitations are blocked.": "直接交易只限同一模式。跨模式的組隊邀請會被擋下。",
    "Standard characters cannot supply Classic characters with Standard buffs or healing.": "標準角色不能提供經典角色標準模式的輔助魔法或治癒。",
    "Standard characters cannot freely attack Classic characters. If a Classic character initiates against a Standard character, that Standard character receives a 30-second retaliation window; doorway abuse and formal combat/war contexts have their own guarded exceptions.": "標準角色不能隨意攻擊經典角色。若經典角色先對標準角色出手，該標準角色會獲得 30 秒的反擊時間；門口卡位濫用與正式決鬥／宣戰情境有各自的例外處理。",
    "Classic has its own spawn/drop variants where content needs separate tuning;": "需要分開調整的內容，經典有自己的出沒／掉落版本；",
    "identifies many Classic boss and monster variants.": "標示許多經典版的 Boss 與怪物。",
    "Some web-account limits are deliberately separate by profile, allowing one Standard and one Classic entitlement rather than letting one side consume the other side’s allowance.": "部分網站帳號上限刻意依模式分開，讓標準與經典各有一份額度，而不是讓一邊吃掉另一邊的額度。",
    "This separation is broader than a simple rate switch. It prevents Standard farming, buffs, and economy from becoming shortcuts for Classic progression.": "這樣的區隔不只是切換倍率而已，它避免標準模式的打寶、輔助魔法與經濟變成經典模式成長的捷徑。",
    "Rework. Standard and Classic share the same underlying level difficulty curve; their profile EXP rates are applied afterward. Most of levels 5–47 use approximately half of the stock-sty…": "重做。標準與經典共用同一條底層等級難度曲線，再套用各自模式的經驗值倍率。5–47 級大多只需要原版約一半的經驗值…",
    "Rework.": "重做。",
    "Standard and Classic share the same underlying level difficulty curve; their profile EXP rates are applied afterward.": "標準與經典共用同一條底層等級難度曲線，再套用各自模式的經驗值倍率。",
    "Most of levels 5–47 use approximately half of the stock-style requirement.": "5–47 級大多只需要原版約一半的升級經驗值。",
