    "Level 77 and above use an intentionally enormous requirement, making 77 the practical cap rather than opening an uncontrolled high-level race.": "77 級以上刻意設定極高的需求，讓 77 成為實際上限，而不是開放一場失控的高等級競賽。",
    "The website EXP table and the in-game": "網站的經驗值表與遊戲內的",
