    "Beyond 14 combat hours: 40%.": "超過 14 小時戰鬥時間：40%。",
    "Unused full-rate time can roll into the next day, up to a maximum full-rate allowance of 16 hours. Safe-zone, trading, and ordinary online time do not consume combat time. The game announces tier changes instead of silently changing the rate.": "沒用完的全倍率時間可以累積到隔天，全倍率額度最多 16 小時。安全區、交易與一般上線時間不會消耗戰鬥時間。遊戲會公告級距變化，不會默默改變倍率。",
    "Addition: Standard characters can build and consume Einhasad Blessing for 2x EXP while points remain. Classic characters do not receive that multiplier. Party buff: The bonus portion gene…": "新增：標準角色可以累積並消耗 殷海薩的祝福換取 2 倍經驗值，直到點數用完。經典角色沒有這個倍率。組隊加成：隊友產生的加成部分…",
    "Addition:": "新增：",
    "Standard characters can build and consume Einhasad Blessing for": "標準角色可以累積並消耗 殷海薩的祝福換取",
