    "while points remain. Classic characters do not receive that multiplier.": "，直到點數用完。經典角色沒有這個倍率。",
    "Party buff:": "組隊加成：",
    "The bonus portion generated by party members (and the additional Royal party bonus) uses a": "隊友產生的加成部分（以及王族額外的組隊加成）使用",
