    "Eligible online players receive": "符合資格的線上玩家每 10 分鐘獲得",
    "10 Reborn Feathers": "10 個 Reborn 羽毛",
    "(the stock item name is Sacred Wing Feather) every 10 minutes; the timed award is limited by linked web account/IP rather than multiplying freely across alts.": "（原版道具名為 Sacred Wing Feather）；這項定時獎勵依綁定的網站帳號／IP 限制，不會因分身帳號而無限倍增。",
    "QoL:": "便利性：",
    "The stock level 15, 30, 45, and 50 class quests complete automatically when the character reaches the required level, including their class reward. Existing completed quests are not duplicated.": "原版 15、30、45、50 級的職業任務會在角色達到等級時自動完成，包含職業獎勵。已完成的任務不會重複。",
    "Addition. Growth Fruit can activate time on up to five characters of the same game account. The number of active characters determines the account's Chain grade: grade 1–5 grants 1–5…": "新增。成長果實可以為同一遊戲帳號最多五個角色啟動時間。啟動中的角色數決定帳號的成長之鏈等級：1–5 級給 1–5…",
    "Growth Fruit can activate time on up to five characters of the same game account. The number of active characters determines the account's Chain grade: grade 1–5 grants 1–5 AC, grades 3–5 also grant 2 DR, and grade 5 grants +5% EXP. Active accounts earn 20,000 Tam points per linked active character for each configured hour of eligible online progress. Additional fruit uses can queue limited future time instead of wasting an already-active item.": "成長果實可以為同一遊戲帳號最多五個角色啟動時間。啟動中的角色數決定帳號的成長之鏈等級：1–5 級給 1–5 AC，3–5 級再給 2 DR，5 級另外給 +5% 經驗值。啟動中的帳號每個綁定的啟動角色，在每個設定的有效上線小時可獲得 20,000 Tam 點數。額外使用果實會把有限的未來時間排入佇列，不會浪費已啟動的道具。",
    "Rework. Base HP/MP growth is clamped cleanly to the configured class ceilings: Class Base HP cap Base MP cap Royal 1,400 800 Knight 2,000 600 Elf 1,400 900 Mage 1,000 1,200 Dark Elf 1,400…": "重做。基礎 HP／MP 成長會乾淨地限制在各職業設定的上限：職業 基礎 HP 上限 基礎 MP 上限 王族 1,400 800 騎士 2,000 600 妖精 1,400 900 法師 1,000 1,200 黑暗妖精 1,400…",
    "Base HP/MP growth is clamped cleanly to the configured class ceilings:": "基礎 HP／MP 成長會乾淨地限制在各職業設定的上限：",
    "Equipment, buffs, runes, and other temporary or item-derived bonuses are applied separately.": "裝備、輔助魔法、符文與其他暫時或道具帶來的加成另外計算。",
    "Rework. EXP loss is based on a fraction of the current level's requirement rather than one flat percentage forever: 5% through level 44, 4% at 45–49, 3% at 50–64, 2% at 65–69, then…": "重做。經驗值損失改以當前等級所需經驗值的比例計算，而不是永遠固定一個百分比：44 級以前 5%，45–49 級 4%，50–64 級 3%，65–69 級 2%，之後…",
    "EXP loss is based on a fraction of the current level's requirement rather than one flat percentage forever: 5% through level 44, 4% at 45–49, 3% at 50–64, 2% at 65–69, then sharply smaller steps from 1% at 70 to 0.025% at 76–79. Classic loss is profile-scaled so its 1x progression is not charged as though it earned Standard's 5x EXP.": "經驗值損失改以當前等級所需經驗值的比例計算，而不是永遠固定一個百分比：44 級以前 5%，45–49 級 4%，50–64 級 3%，65–69 級 2%，之後從 70 級的 1% 急遽縮小到 76–79 級的 0.025%。經典的損失會依模式換算，不會把 1 倍的成長當成賺到標準 5 倍經驗值來扣。",
    "The ordinary EXP recovery path restores half of the calculated loss. Preservation runes can reduce the loss and have a small chance to prevent it entirely. Siege deaths do not carry normal EXP loss, and short verified disconnect/lag incidents have dedicated death-penalty protection.": "一般的經驗值回復途徑可找回計算損失的一半。保存符文可以減少損失，並有小機率完全避免。攻城戰死亡不會有一般的經驗值損失，經核實的短暫斷線／延遲事件也有專屬的死亡懲罰保護。",
    "Fix/Buff.": "修正／強化。",
    "Stock contains several exact-value checks that accidentally remove a top starting-stat bonus if the stat is raised beyond the exact breakpoint. Reborn changes those checks to “at least” checks. For example, a bonus intended for original STR 20 remains active at STR 21+, and the same principle applies to affected CON, DEX, WIS, and INT breakpoints across the classes.": "原版有幾處精確數值判定，若能力值超過門檻反而會意外取消最高初始能力值加成。Reborn 把這些判定改成「至少」判定。例如原本給初始 STR 20 的加成，在 STR 21 以上仍然有效；各職業受影響的 CON、DEX、WIS、INT 門檻也適用同樣原則。",
    "Reborn turns Royal into a real frontline leader and group enabler rather than a pledge-administration class with a few auras.": "Reborn 把王族變成真正的前線領袖與團隊支援者，而不是只有幾個光輝的血盟管理職業。",
