    "Shield-using Elves receive half of the Royal shield hit and half-hit proc chance, but do not receive the Royal’s passive shield DR bonus.": "使用盾牌的妖精獲得王族盾牌命中與減半攻擊觸發機率的一半，但沒有王族的被動盾牌 DR 加成。",
    "Top original CON, DEX, and WIS bonuses remain active above their stock exact-value breakpoints.": "最高級的初始 CON、DEX、WIS 加成，超過原版精確門檻後仍然有效。",
    "Buff: Most bread-and-butter elemental weapon, party, skin, and movement buffs last 16 minutes. Elemental Fire lasts about 5 minutes 20 seconds; Soul of Flame lasts about 2 minutes 10 seco…": "強化：大多數常用的屬性武器、組隊、防護與移動類輔助魔法持續 16 分鐘。屬性之火約 5 分 20 秒；烈焰之魂約 2 分 10 秒…",
    "Most bread-and-butter elemental weapon, party, skin, and movement buffs last 16 minutes.": "大多數常用的屬性武器、組隊、防護與移動類輔助魔法持續 16 分鐘。",
