    "WHY LINEAGE 1 REBORN?": "為什麼選擇 LINEAGE 1 REBORN？",
    "The Lineage you remember.": "你記憶中的天堂。",
    "The world you wished for.": "你曾盼望的世界。",
    "That first rare drop. A pledge that becomes family.": "第一次掉落稀有道具。一個變成家人的血盟。",
    "A castle worth fighting for.": "一座值得奮戰的城堡。",
    "Return to Lineage: The Blood Pledge, thoughtfully evolved with build-defining runes, deeper pets, challenging endgame and modern conveniences. The soul of the original, with new reasons to fall in love.": "回到《天堂》，經過用心演進：決定配置的符文、更深入的寵物、有挑戰性的後期內容與現代化的便利功能。保留原作的靈魂，再給你重新愛上它的理由。",
    "Download & play": "下載並開始遊玩",
    "Discover the difference": "看看哪裡不一樣",
    "Free to play · No pay-to-win · Lineage 3.63C": "免費遊玩 · 沒有課金優勢 · 天堂 3.63C",
    "Your progress is earned.": "你的進度靠自己掙來。",
    "No pay-to-win. No shortcut to combat power.": "沒有課金優勢，沒有戰力捷徑。",
    "Two worlds. Your pace.": "兩個世界，照你的步調。",
    "Standard x5 and Classic Style x1.": "標準 x5 與經典風格 x1。",
    "A community with a voice.": "一個有發言權的社群。",
    "Player feedback helps shape what comes next.": "玩家的回饋會影響接下來的方向。",
    "FAMILIAR ROOTS. FRESH POSSIBILITIES.": "熟悉的根基，全新的可能。",
    "More adventure.": "更多冒險。",
    "Less getting in its way.": "更少阻礙。",
    "Keep the danger, the rivalries and the long-term goals. Add thoughtful systems that make the time you spend in Aden more rewarding.": "保留危險、對抗與長期目標，再加上經過思考的系統，讓你在亞丁花的每一分鐘更有收穫。",
    "QUALITY OF LIFE": "便利性",
    "Spend your evening adventuring.": "把整個晚上留給冒險。",
    "Auto potions, item protection, party mana displays and offline shops take care of the little things. Connected markets and detailed lookups help you plan your next move.": "自動藥水、道具保護、隊伍魔力顯示與離線商店幫你處理瑣事。連動的市場與詳細的查詢工具，讓你規劃下一步。",
    "Explore player tools": "探索玩家工具",
    "BUILDS WITH IDENTITY": "有個性的配置",
    "Make your character your own.": "打造專屬於你的角色。",
    "Seven familiar classes, thoughtfully refined. Collect and combine runes across three slots to shape your strengths, discover synergies and give your next upgrade a purpose.": "七個熟悉的職業，經過用心調整。在三個欄位收集並組合符文，塑造你的強項、發掘協同效果，讓下一次升級有明確目標。",
    "Discover the rune system": "認識符文系統",
    "COMPANIONS THAT GROW": "會成長的同伴",
    "More than a pet at your heels.": "不只是跟在腳邊的寵物。",
    "Build a hunting partner with branching talents, critical strikes and deeper controls. Decide how your companions fight, support them and watch them grow alongside you.": "用分支天賦、爆擊與更深入的操控打造狩獵夥伴。決定同伴怎麼戰鬥、支援牠們，看著牠們與你一起成長。",
    "Meet your next companion": "認識你的下一位同伴",
    "A WORLD WORTH EXPLORING": "值得探索的世界",
    "Always another reason to venture out.": "總有再出門的理由。",
    "Rotating bonus EXP maps, over 100 kill quests, seasonal events and renewed hunting grounds give familiar paths new purpose. Follow your own goals or bring your party.": "輪替的經驗值加成地圖、超過 100 個擊殺任務、季節活動與翻新的狩獵場，讓熟悉的路有新的目的。追求自己的目標，或帶上隊伍一起。",
    "Find your next hunting ground": "找你的下一個狩獵場",
    "ENDGAME WITH TEETH": "有牙齒的後期內容",
    "Bring a party. Leave with a story.": "帶隊伍進去，帶故事出來。",
    "Hard Mode turns familiar territory into a serious challenge. Face the eight Justices of Lastavard together, earn exclusive loot and put your party on the completion board.": "困難模式把熟悉的地盤變成真正的挑戰。一起面對拉斯塔巴德的八位暗影法官，取得專屬戰利品，讓你的隊伍登上通關榜。",
    "Enter L4 Justices Hard Mode": "進入 L4 暗影法官困難模式",
    "RIVALRY & BELONGING": "對抗與歸屬",
    "Find your people. Fight for your place.": "找到你的夥伴，為你的位置而戰。",
    "Pledge warfare, castle sieges, open-world PvP and structured arenas keep competition alive. Detailed siege recaps recognize the healing, damage and objectives behind the victory.": "血盟戰爭、攻城戰、開放世界 PvP 與有制度的競技場讓競爭持續。詳細的攻城回顧會記下勝利背後的治癒、傷害與目標。",
    "Discover castle warfare": "認識攻城戰",
    "CHOOSE YOUR KIND OF JOURNEY": "選擇你的旅程",
    "One love for Lineage.": "同一份對天堂的愛。",
    "Two ways to live it.": "兩種體驗方式。",
