    "THE EXPANDED REBORN EXPERIENCE": "擴充版的 REBORN 體驗",
    "A broader take on Aden, with expanded progression and Reborn’s custom systems. For players who want familiar foundations and more to discover.": "更寬廣的亞丁，具備擴充的成長與 Reborn 的自訂系統。適合想要熟悉基礎、又想發掘更多的玩家。",
