    "Classic Style": "經典風格",
    "For those who love the long road. A slower, more restrained profile where patient progression and the familiar rhythm of Lineage take centre stage.": "給喜歡長路的人。更慢、更克制的模式，耐心的成長與天堂熟悉的節奏才是主角。",
    "Explore Classic Style": "探索經典風格",
    "Features and rules differ by world. Explore each profile before choosing your path.": "功能與規則依世界不同。選擇之前先了解各個模式。",
    "BUILT WITH HEART. SHAPED TOGETHER.": "用心打造，一起塑造。",
    "A world is only as good": "一個世界的好壞",
    "as the people in it.": "取決於裡面的人。",
    "Reborn is an ode to Lineage, built from years of memories and the belief that its best stories are still ahead. The community helps write the next chapter.": "Reborn 是獻給天堂的頌歌，源自多年的回憶，以及相信它最好的故事還在前方。社群一起寫下一章。",
    "Progress worth protecting.": "值得守護的進度。",
    "Anti-dupe safeguards, valuable-item tracking and transaction auditing help protect the economy and the time you invest. Active administration investigates cheating and abuse.": "防複製機制、貴重道具追蹤與交易稽核保護經濟與你投入的時間。管理團隊會主動調查作弊與濫用。",
    "How we protect the world": "我們如何守護這個世界",
    "Rivalry belongs. Harassment doesn’t.": "對抗是遊戲的一部分，騷擾不是。",
    "Bring your competitive spirit. Cheating, harassment and excessive toxicity are actively addressed, while feedback and server-direction polls give players a voice.": "帶著你的競爭心來。作弊、騷擾與過度惡意會被積極處理；回饋與伺服器方向投票則讓玩家有發言權。",
    "Support the world, not a power gap.": "支持這個世界，而不是製造戰力差距。",
    "Reborn is free to play. Supporter perks are clearly marked as cosmetic or convenience features, without direct combat-power bonuses.": "Reborn 免費遊玩。支持者福利都明確標示為外觀或便利功能，沒有直接的戰力加成。",
    "See exactly what support includes": "看看支持者福利包含什麼",
